3，仕六进五，再卒5进1，则兵三进—，黑方也失先。","text":" 如果改走炮3进3，仕六进五，再卒5进1，则兵三进—，黑方也失先。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"0:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment31:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment31","raw_text":" 正着。如改走车九平六，则车8进4，黑方有车换双炮的手段。","text":" 正着。如改走车九平六，则车8进4，黑方有车换双炮的手段。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":31,"anchor_node_id":"0:31","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment35:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment35","raw_text":" 及时，伏有马五进六的凶着。","text":" 及时，伏有马五进六的凶着。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":35,"anchor_node_id":"0:35","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment46:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment46","raw_text":" 如改走炮4平5，则马六退五，车2平5，车一平五，也是红方胜。","text":" 如改走炮4平5，则马六退五，车2平5，车一平五，也是红方胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":46,"anchor_node_id":"0:46","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment47:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment47","raw_text":"红胜。","text":"红胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":47,"anchor_node_id":"0:47","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_49:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_49","raw_text":"也是红胜。","text":"也是红胜。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":49,"anchor_node_id":"1:49","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_25","raw_text":"黑方也失先。","text":"黑方也失先。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"2:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["8979695949392919097717866646260600102030405060708012720323436383"],"DhtmlXQ_pver":["091016"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["[第28局：中炮过河车对屏风马左马盘河 胡荣华先胜张仲保"],"DhtmlXQ_firstnum":["0"],"DhtmlXQ_length":["0"],"DhtmlXQ_class":["象棋谱大全-现代棋书专集"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["胡荣华妙局精萃"],"DhtmlXQ_black":["越南张仲保"],"DhtmlXQ_result":["红胜"],"DhtmlXQ_hidden":["0"]},"source_tag_count":25,"identical_tag_duplic